WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.280
A family asks Malou about help with medicine. She clarifies the need and whether urgent health referral is required.

2
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:18.860
At the RHU, Malou asks the midwife who is currently responsible. The midwife and PHN may guide BHWs according to local assignments.

3
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:31.520
The mayor chairs the local health board and the CHO or MHO is vice-chair. It proposes budget allocations and advises, but has not approved this family's request.

4
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:43.700
The BHW president may help coordinate. For possible social assistance, ask for the local contact and procedure; social support is separate from clinical decisions.

5
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:54.640
Malou seeks consent and shares only necessary information with the verified contact. She does not send a full health record to an arbitrary official.

6
00:00:54.940 --> 00:01:04.540
Malou records the agreed next step and follows up with the family. She promises neither funding nor an outcome while the proper assessment is pending.
